{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-28T06:20:35.648Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6-astra","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"a93e720b43f998067315057f","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6-astra","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-bj7rq0"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Diagnose repeated CLI startup budget overruns and distinguish runner qualification from command regressions"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The 2026-09-28 ecosystem review ran the unchanged CLI transport-floor gate against fresh isolated one-item trackers. The first run failed list at 442 ms versus the fixed 419 ms ceiling. A second isolated run failed get 385/362 ms, context 466/433 ms, next 457/440 ms and create 424/398 ms. Source, benchmark code and budgets were unchanged. The SDK import gate initially failed even bare Node at 305/106 ms but passed its isolated rerun. These observations establish repeated local admission failures, not their cause or a production regression. Determine whether runner contention, runtime state or a reproducible command regression explains the changing failures."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-09-28T06:20:35.648Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-28T06:20:35.648Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Reproduce with recorded runtime and runner-pressure evidence on an isolated supported environment and compare the unchanged base revision; Classify runner qualification separately from product admission without treating failed or unavailable measurements as passes; Fix only the demonstrated cause and preserve every latency and RSS ratchet unless an explicitly reviewed platform correction is supported; Add positive and negative regression controls proving real command regressions still fail and any runner refusal is explicit"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-o87av6"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A qualified runner passes unchanged supported-runtime startup budgets, and genuine command regressions remain fail-closed with attributable evidence."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Two transport-floor runs failed fixed latency ceilings across changing commands; independent SDK import rerun passed. The broad static invocation therefore cannot be reported all green."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-o87av6","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-09-28T06:20:35.648Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-p9a4","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-09-28T06:20:35.648Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-yse5dt","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-09-28T06:20:35.648Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-09-28T06:20:35.648Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"text: Duplicate check 2026-09-28: inspected the complete all-status corpus for startup, latency, entrypoint and benchmark owners and ran the live all-status CLI startup budget search. The completed transport-floor owner pm-yse5dt remains closed: its ten-sample im